000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. BILLDRV.
000300*  Drives the billing run: re-prices an order with the PL/I
000400*  routine (its RECALC entry) and formats the amount with the
000500*  Assembler routine (its BILLALT entry).
000600 DATA DIVISION.
000700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000800 01  WS-ORDER-ID             PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
000900 01  WS-AMOUNT               PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
001000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001100 MAIN-PARA.
001200     CALL 'RECALC' USING WS-ORDER-ID WS-AMOUNT.
001300     PERFORM 3 TIMES
001400        CALL 'BILLALT' USING WS-AMOUNT
001500     END-PERFORM.
001600     GOBACK.
